#created by Duel Circuit - No Limits: Fiendsmith Ryzeal, winter 2024-25 (Tova "Detonator")
#title Fiendsmith Ryzeal (2025, uncut)
#era 2025
#tier No Limits peak build: pool (docs/dev/NO-LIMITS-SPEC-2026-11-02.md section 5)
#about Won YCS Orlando (February 2025, 2,223 players), where 24 of the Top 64 were Fiendsmith Ryzeal and nearly half of every premier top cut that winter was Ryzeal. Ice, Sword and Ext Ryzeal make Rank 4s into Ryzeal Detonator; Fiendsmith adds Requiem, Sequence and Agnumday. Here with three Sword Ryzeal and the banned Rank 4 toolbox: Lavalval Chain, Daigusto Emeral and Fairy Tail - Snow keep the Level 4s coming back.
#why Peak list: February 2025; restored: Ryzeal Detonator (Extra, 2), Ext Ryzeal x3, Ice Ryzeal x3, Sword Ryzeal x3; picks: Fairy Tail - Snow, Lavalval Chain (Extra), Daigusto Emeral (Extra); held back: Pot of Greed; cuts: Effect Veiler x1 (hand trap), Chaos Angel and Necroquip Princess (Extra). Measured 2026-11-03: rated 1673 (-194 under ryzeal 1867; its playbook work is parked with the tuning pass).
#banlist TCG December 2024
#recipe ryzeal
